Staying with breakthroughs that restore lost function,

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:18.720
a gene therapy has just been approved that gave hearing to a child born completely deaf.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:23.200
Regeneron received regulatory approval for a groundbreaking gene therapy.

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.880
It restored hearing in a child born completely unable to hear.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:30.600
The treatment allowed personality and communication abilities to emerge.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:36.260
The case marks a concrete advance in genetic medicines for sensory disorders long considered

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:39.700
untreatable. While that therapy restores one sensory pathway,

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:44.540
a very different kind of intervention is showing promise in restoring movement for people with

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:49.320
stiff person syndrome. Kaiverna therapeutics published complete results from its

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:55.180
registration trial of MIV cell. This is a CAR-T therapy for patients with stiff person syndrome.

00:04:55.780 --> 00:05:00.620
The data positions the treatment as a potential first approved CAR-T for any autoimmune condition.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:05.260
